    "title": "A Recipe for Danger: Social media challenges involving medicines - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago INDIANA — Federal health officials are warning parents and caregivers about a dangerous intersection of viral internet trends and over-the-counter (OTC) medications. Driven by peer pressure and the desire for online validation, social media challenges encouraging youths to misuse readily available household medicines pose severe health risks—and in some cases, can prove fatal. Read full article",
